{"4868890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Hole", "steam_appid": 4868890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4888610], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Hole is a relaxing first-person simulation game focused on resource gathering, card collecting, production, and trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small Hole and gradually build your own production business. Discover new cards by opening boxes, expand your production areas, collect resources with your Hole, and grow your business through trading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Resources<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/b61200954c99aad7a4ee28cc9dd86ada.poster.avif?t=1788271078\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/b61200954c99aad7a4ee28cc9dd86ada.webm?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/b61200954c99aad7a4ee28cc9dd86ada.mp4?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources produced in your production areas using your Hole and store them in your inventory. Upgrade your Hole to gather resources more efficiently and increase your productivity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover New Cards<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/193ea63a95c4085bf1254c46728b4916.poster.avif?t=1788271078\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/193ea63a95c4085bf1254c46728b4916.webm?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/193ea63a95c4085bf1254c46728b4916.mp4?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase boxes and obtain random cards. Each card unlocks new trees, plants, or animals that can be placed in your production areas and help expand your business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Production Areas<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/fa97fa81cb72b734649daaea764f3cb6.poster.avif?t=1788271078\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/fa97fa81cb72b734649daaea764f3cb6.webm?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/fa97fa81cb72b734649daaea764f3cb6.mp4?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the trees, plants, and animals you unlock into your production areas. Increase your production capacity, unlock new areas, and fulfill larger customer orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade With Customers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/5332dbea1d8aead0fe7e5ccdef254bd0.poster.avif?t=1788271078\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/5332dbea1d8aead0fe7e5ccdef254bd0.webm?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/5332dbea1d8aead0fe7e5ccdef254bd0.mp4?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different customer types and evaluate incoming offers. Accept, reject, or hold orders for later. Make profitable deals and keep your business growing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Hole<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/6ba3933d812a04b239a46dcec8b8731c.poster.avif?t=1788271078\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/6ba3933d812a04b239a46dcec8b8731c.webm?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4868890/extras/6ba3933d812a04b239a46dcec8b8731c.mp4?t=1788271078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings into Hole upgrades. Improve your efficiency, collect resources faster, and support your expanding production operation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards of the same rarity to obtain higher rarity cards. Build a stronger collection and unlock new opportunities as your business grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new cards, produce more resources, expand your production areas, and build an ever-growing trading network. Every investment brings you closer to a larger and more profitable business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique Hole-based resource gathering system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Random card opening system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Card merging and rarity progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tree, plant, and animal-based production</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customer offers and trading mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Different customer types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Area expansion and progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Various Hole upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Relaxing gameplay at your own p